{"pages":[{"segs":[["MISSIONAL MAP 1",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,578.65549999999996,9,false],["MISSIONAL MAP",150.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,442.74000000000001,116.00059999999996,80,false],["\"HOW-TO\" GUIDE",150.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,441.12400000000002,176.00059999999996,80,false],["DEMARICK PATTON",150.90000000000001,167.78059999999994,332.69799999999998,194.10059999999999,20,false],["same names.) Spend some time praying as a group for",370.20000000000005,230.16619999999989,572.21130000000016,242.56819999999993,9,false],["one another and that God would lead the team to the",370.20000000000005,243.16619999999989,567.62130000000025,255.56819999999993,9,false],["mission He has for them.",370.20000000000005,256.16619999999989,464.61810000000003,268.56819999999993,9,false],["Second: Use the questions on the left side to aid in",370.20000000000005,281.83320000000003,562.26660000000015,295.21620000000001,9,false],["identifying the people group that God is sending the",370.20000000000005,295.1662,565.83120000000019,307.56819999999999,9,false],["missional team to engage. This process may take an",370.20000000000005,308.1662,564.75030000000015,320.56819999999999,9,false],["hour or a few days dependent upon the group and how",370.20000000000005,321.1662,573.76920000000007,333.56819999999999,9,false],["God leads you. Encourage everyone to take notes from",370.20000000000005,334.1662,574.4892000000001,346.56819999999999,9,false],["the discussion.",370.20000000000005,347.1662,426.94500000000005,359.56819999999999,9,false],["The missional map was created to help any",146.40000000000001,355.80649999999997,308.77620000000013,368.20849999999996,9,false],["missionally-minded group of people identify, pray for,",146.40000000000001,368.80649999999997,349.21230000000014,381.20849999999996,9,false],["and begin to engage a group of people who are not yet",146.40000000000001,381.80649999999997,346.3053000000001,394.20849999999996,9,false],["following Christ. It is not meant to be a planning tool,",146.40000000000001,394.80649999999997,347.25840000000017,407.20849999999996,9,false],["but a starting place for mission. It is best used when a",146.40000000000001,407.80649999999997,347.99730000000005,420.20849999999996,9,false],["“team” (missionally-minded group) has a coach, has",146.40000000000001,420.80649999999997,343.03920000000011,433.20849999999996,9,false],["clearly identified their Kingdom vision, is regularly",146.40000000000001,433.80649999999997,339.73530000000005,446.20849999999996,9,false],["working on a plan for mission, and is being equipped",146.40000000000001,446.80649999999997,344.34420000000011,459.20849999999996,9,false],["for the work (in essence, The Five Things.)",146.40000000000001,459.80649999999997,308.00220000000007,472.20849999999996,9,false],["Third: After identifying the group that God is sending",370.20000000000005,372.83320000000003,575.0286000000001,386.21620000000001,9,false],["the missional team to, have each person give the",370.20000000000005,386.1662,551.67420000000016,398.56819999999999,9,false],["names of the people that God has laid on their heart.",370.20000000000005,399.1662,566.91930000000025,411.56819999999999,9,false],["You may not be able to list everyone’s names the first",370.20000000000005,412.1662,568.6563000000001,424.56819999999999,9,false],["time. Also, it is unlikely that one person will know",370.20000000000005,425.1662,558.32429999999999,437.56819999999999,9,false],["everyone on the list, but the point is that we pray for",370.20000000000005,438.1662,566.20830000000012,450.56819999999999,9,false],["our teammates’ friends and hopefully get to know",370.20000000000005,451.1662,557.44320000000016,463.56819999999999,9,false],["them over time.",370.20000000000005,464.1662,429.80700000000002,476.56819999999999,9,false],["The term “map” is used to give someone the sense of",146.40000000000001,485.80649999999997,343.69620000000009,498.20849999999996,9,false],["seeing the whole on one page. The “whole” they get to",146.40000000000001,498.80650000000003,347.56620000000009,511.20850000000002,9,false],["see is themselves, a team, going after a specified group",146.40000000000001,511.80650000000003,350.49930000000006,524.20849999999996,9,false],["of people that God has led them to engage for a certain",146.40000000000001,524.80650000000003,350.56320000000017,537.20849999999996,9,false],["period of time.",146.40000000000001,537.80649999999991,201.73200000000003,550.20849999999996,9,false],["A missional team is not restricted to identify and",146.40000000000001,563.80649999999991,331.20330000000007,576.20849999999996,9,false],["engage only 20 people. However, most missional",146.40000000000001,576.80649999999991,328.99020000000007,589.20849999999996,9,false],["efforts lose effectiveness as the target is often too",146.40000000000001,589.80649999999991,332.02319999999997,602.20849999999996,9,false],["large and ambiguous. Hence, there are twenty slots to",146.40000000000001,602.80649999999991,348.02520000000015,615.20849999999996,9,false],["list the people that God is calling a missional team to",146.40000000000001,615.80649999999991,345.02640000000008,628.20849999999996,9,false],["pursue.",146.40000000000001,628.80649999999991,174.84900000000002,641.20849999999996,9,false],["Fourth: Determine the date that the team will begin",370.20000000000005,489.83320000000003,568.51350000000014,503.21620000000001,9,false],["to intentionally engage this group of people and the",370.20000000000005,503.1662,563.53710000000012,515.56819999999993,9,false],["date when as the team they will end the effort. This is",370.20000000000005,516.1662,570.9162,528.56819999999993,9,false],["a very important step as it is biblically modeled and it",370.20000000000005,529.1662,571.66230000000019,541.56819999999993,9,false],["creates urgency and incentive. (Suggested time: 1-3",370.20000000000005,542.1662,564.30120000000011,554.56819999999993,9,false],["years.) Sketch a plan on how the missional team will",370.20000000000005,555.1662,567.39720000000011,567.56819999999993,9,false],["go about the missional enterprise (e.g. strategic plan",370.20000000000005,568.1662,567.47820000000013,580.56819999999993,9,false],["lite). The plan will need to be regularly revisited and",370.20000000000005,581.1662,567.07320000000016,593.56819999999993,9,false],["modified as necessary and as the Lord leads. Coaching",370.20000000000005,594.1662,574.61430000000018,606.56819999999993,9,false],["is needed here.",370.20000000000005,607.1662,426.67500000000007,619.56819999999993,9,false],["It should be expected however, that God would lead",146.40000000000001,654.80650000000003,340.13220000000001,667.20849999999996,9,false],["people across a team’s path that were not initially on a",146.40000000000001,667.80650000000003,350.39220000000012,680.20849999999996,9,false],["their map; that’s a great thing!",146.40000000000001,680.80650000000003,259.41210000000001,693.20849999999996,9,false],["First: Have the missional team you are on and\/",146.40000000000001,706.47350000000006,325.92980000000011,719.85649999999998,9,false],["or coaching,;; write their names in the team slot.",146.40000000000001,719.80650000000003,328.04430000000002,732.20849999999996,9,false],["(Everyone fills out their own writing down all the",146.40000000000001,732.80650000000003,332.36520000000007,745.20849999999996,9,false],["Finally: Use the continuum to chart the progress of",370.20000000000005,632.83320000000003,566.6585,646.21619999999996,9,false],["each person on the list as they journey towards Christ.",370.20000000000005,646.1662,575.18130000000019,658.56819999999993,9,false],["As you observe a person take the next step, write in",370.20000000000005,659.1662,562.38420000000019,671.56819999999993,9,false],["the date by their name, and praise God that they are a",370.20000000000005,672.1662,570.56430000000023,684.56819999999993,9,false],["step closer to following Jesus! (Of course it is possible",370.20000000000005,685.1662,574.00320000000011,697.56819999999993,9,false],["for a person to backtrack; keep praying for them.)",370.20000000000005,698.1662,555.9303000000001,710.56819999999993,9,false],["The continuum of course does not end here, but on",370.20000000000005,711.1662,561.77220000000011,723.56819999999993,9,false],["this map, there is no room to display ‘the continuum of",370.20000000000005,724.1662,576.01200000000017,736.56820000000005,9,false],["maturity in Christ’.",370.20000000000005,737.1662,442.76610000000005,749.56820000000005,9,false]],"ocr":false,"h":792,"w":612},{"h":792,"w":612,"segs":[["WHO?",205.91200000000001,553.43200000000002,220.32800000000003,583,16,false],["Trust",194.60499999999999,358,208.12,392.64999999999998,15,false],["Me\/Us? Growing Curiosity?",193.59999999999999,244.34500000000003,220.12,400.27000000000004,15,false],["open to change? seeking God? Following Jesus?",191.60499999999999,21.205000000000041,219.11500000000001,283.89249999999998,15,false],["(DATE) (DATE) (DATE) (DATE) (DATE)",226.654,58.611999999999966,239.91200000000003,413.904,14,false],["MISSIONAL",23.367999999999991,595.56799999999998,44.992000000000004,728,24,false],["TEAM Launch DATE:",39.912000000000006,457.33600000000001,54.32800000000001,583,16,false],["1.",49.297999999999995,374.06400000000002,61.912000000000006,387,14,false],["5.",49.087999999999958,187.346,61.701999999999963,200.28200000000004,14,false],["2.",65.299999999999955,374.06400000000002,77.913999999999959,387,14,false],["6.",65.090000000000032,187.346,77.704000000000036,200.28200000000004,14,false],["[ ] [ ]OuR TEAM [IF IN A SMALL GROUP, GO MISSIONAL TOGETHER]",-18.70999999999998,45.19600000000014,134.69000000000005,775,130,false],["OUR TEAM’s",26.10048559999996,733.30619999999999,118.50661239999997,751.35761600000001,20.000001155999968,false],["MAP",38.472000000000001,600.86400000000003,124.96800000000002,732,96,false],["3.",82.295999999999935,374.06400000000002,94.90999999999994,387,14,false],["7.",82.086000000000013,187.346,94.700000000000017,200.28200000000004,14,false],["APPROX. LANDING DATE:",91.912000000000006,427.76800000000003,106.32800000000002,583,16,false],["4.",98.298000000000002,374.06400000000002,110.91200000000001,387,14,false],["8.",98.087999999999965,187.346,110.70199999999997,200.28200000000004,14,false],["Identifying the people He is",138.37700000000001,622.70400000000006,148.28800000000001,765,11,false],["sending us to...Pray and be",149.37700000000001,627.78600000000006,159.28800000000001,765,11,false],["filled with God’s Spirit and ask",160.37700000000001,602.37600000000009,170.28800000000001,765,11,false],["THE POSTMODERN SOJOURNER’S CONTINUUM Created for the purpose of journeying others to the Kingdom.",140.36799999999999,39.999500000000126,171.49600000000004,447.48340000000002,24,false],["Him to lead you to the people He",171.37700000000001,602.37600000000009,181.28800000000001,765,11,false],["has on your journey.",182.37700000000001,663.36000000000001,192.28800000000001,765,11,false],["Use the following two questions",198.38200000000001,607.45800000000008,208.29300000000001,765,11,false],["to help with the clarification",209.38200000000001,612.53999999999996,219.29300000000001,765,11,false],["process.",220.38200000000001,724.34400000000005,230.29300000000001,765,11,false],["1. Is God sending us to people",237.37700000000001,613.38700000000006,247.28800000000001,765,11,false],["where we live, work, play, or",248.37700000000001,603.22300000000007,258.28800000000001,750.601,11,false],["1.",244.684,568.91200000000003,255.49600000000001,580,12,false],["some other group?",259.37700000000001,664.20699999999999,269.28800000000001,750.601,11,false],["2.",260.67999999999995,568.91200000000003,271.49199999999996,580,12,false],["2. Who has God already placed in",270.37700000000001,603.22300000000007,280.28800000000001,765,11,false],["our path, in our care, or on",281.37700000000001,608.30500000000006,291.28800000000001,750.601,11,false],["our hearts?",292.37700000000001,694.69899999999996,302.28800000000001,750.601,11,false],["?’s to consider as we begin",306.29599999999999,593.37400000000002,318.90999999999997,768.00999999999999,14,false],["3.",277.68399999999997,568.91200000000003,288.49599999999998,580,12,false],["4.",293.67999999999995,568.91200000000003,304.49199999999996,580,12,false],["5.",309.67599999999999,568.91200000000003,320.488,580,12,false],["6.",326.67999999999995,568.91200000000003,337.49199999999996,580,12,false],["1. When will we pray for these",327.37700000000001,613.38700000000006,337.28800000000001,765,11,false],["people?",338.37700000000001,715.02700000000004,348.28800000000001,750.601,11,false],["2. How will we bless these",349.37700000000001,633.71500000000003,359.28800000000001,765,11,false],["people?",360.37700000000001,715.02700000000004,370.28800000000001,750.601,11,false],["3. What do we need for our",371.37700000000001,633.71500000000003,381.28800000000001,765,11,false],["“missionary journey?”",382.37700000000001,643.87900000000002,392.28800000000001,750.601,11,false],["4. When will we meet to regularly",393.37700000000001,598.14100000000008,403.28800000000001,765,11,false],["discuss our mission?",404.37700000000001,648.96100000000001,414.28800000000001,750.601,11,false],["ONGOING ?’s TO CONSIDER",416.298,622.31600000000003,428.91199999999998,768,14,false],["7.",342.67599999999999,568.91200000000003,353.488,580,12,false],["8.",359.67999999999995,568.91200000000003,370.49199999999996,580,12,false],["9.",376.68399999999997,568.91200000000003,387.49599999999998,580,12,false],["10.",393.68799999999999,563.36799999999994,404.5,580,12,false],["11.",410.69200000000001,563.36799999999994,421.50400000000002,580,12,false],["12.",426.68799999999999,563.36799999999994,437.5,580,12,false],["1.What are the troubles we can",437.37700000000001,613.70300000000009,447.28800000000001,768,11,false],["come alongside them in?",448.37700000000001,639.11300000000006,458.28800000000001,755.99900000000002,11,false],["13.",443.69200000000001,563.36799999999994,454.50400000000002,580,12,false],["2.What are the questions we are",459.37700000000001,608.62100000000009,469.28800000000001,768,11,false],["asking them?",470.37700000000001,695.01499999999999,480.28800000000001,755.99900000000002,11,false],["3.What are the questions they are",481.37700000000001,598.45700000000011,491.28800000000001,768,11,false],["asking us?",492.37700000000001,705.17899999999997,502.28800000000001,755.99900000000002,11,false],["14.",460.69599999999997,563.36799999999994,471.50799999999998,580,12,false],["15.",476.69199999999995,563.36799999999994,487.50399999999996,580,12,false],["16.",492.68799999999999,563.36799999999994,503.5,580,12,false],["4.How are you continually",503.37700000000001,639.11300000000006,513.28800000000001,768,11,false],["inviting sojourners to be a",514.37699999999995,618.78500000000008,524.28800000000001,755.99900000000002,11,false],["part of your existing",525.37699999999995,649.27700000000004,535.28800000000001,755.99900000000002,11,false],["17.",508.68399999999997,563.36799999999994,519.49599999999998,580,12,false],["18.",524.67999999999995,563.36799999999994,535.49199999999996,580,12,false],["community?",536.37699999999995,705.17899999999997,546.28800000000001,755.99900000000002,11,false],["19.",541.68399999999997,563.36799999999994,552.49599999999998,580,12,false],["“just as the father sent me, I am sending you.” -John 20:21",551.99000000000001,516.74200000000019,573.69999999999993,895.12,13,false],["20.",557.67999999999995,563.36799999999994,568.49199999999996,580,12,false]],"ocr":false},{"ocr":false,"segs":[["THE POSTMODERN SOJOURNER'S",146.40000000000001,35.460100000000011,295.96000000000004,56.000099999999975,20,false],["CONTINUUM DEFINITIONS",146.40000000000001,56.460100000000011,261.30000000000001,77.000099999999975,20,false],["Trust Me\/Us” signifies that this person genuinely",146.40000000000001,89.075099999999907,331.53770000000003,101.47709999999995,9,false],["trusts one of us as a friend and is willing to engage and",146.40000000000001,102.07509999999991,350.82330000000013,114.47709999999995,9,false],["be engaged.",146.40000000000001,115.07509999999991,190.149,127.47709999999995,9,false],["“Growing Curiosity” indicates that this person is",146.40000000000001,141.07509999999991,327.94639999999998,153.47709999999995,9,false],["opening their eyes and mind to the possibility of",146.40000000000001,154.07509999999991,328.00830000000008,166.47709999999995,9,false],["some- thing beyond themselves and their worldview.",146.40000000000001,167.07509999999991,345.8922,179.47709999999995,9,false],["They may ask a few spiritual questions here. Don’t",146.40000000000001,180.07509999999991,336.63030000000003,192.47709999999995,9,false],["pounce prematurely. Ask them questions in return.",146.40000000000001,193.07509999999991,339.36720000000014,205.47709999999995,9,false],["“Open to change” means this person is indicating that",146.40000000000001,219.07509999999991,345.25260000000003,231.47709999999995,9,false],["they would be willing to change their mind, habits,",146.40000000000001,232.07509999999991,336.69330000000002,244.47709999999995,9,false],["beliefs, attitudes, etc. They may not change anything,",146.40000000000001,245.07509999999991,346.43130000000008,257.47709999999995,9,false],["but you will see them ascent to the possibility of some",146.40000000000001,258.07509999999991,349.36620000000005,270.47709999999995,9,false],["changes.",146.40000000000001,271.07509999999991,179.286,283.47709999999995,9,false],["“Seeking God” indicates that this person is looking",146.40000000000001,297.07509999999996,334.33660000000003,309.47709999999995,9,false],["into what Christ and His message of the Kingdom",146.40000000000001,310.07509999999996,334.10220000000004,322.47709999999995,9,false],["offers. They will be engaging with you on biblical",146.40000000000001,323.07509999999996,330.03330000000005,335.47709999999995,9,false],["discussions. Key idea: The conversation is not one-",146.40000000000001,336.07510000000002,338.92620000000011,348.47710000000001,9,false],["sided.",146.40000000000001,349.07510000000002,168.83699999999999,361.47710000000001,9,false],["“Following Jesus” signifies that they have entered",146.40000000000001,375.07510000000002,330.21450000000004,387.47710000000001,9,false],["the Kingdom, received Jesus, made a decision, or",146.40000000000001,388.07510000000002,331.38510000000008,400.47710000000001,9,false],["whatever terminology best suits you. At this stage, you",146.40000000000001,401.07510000000002,351.69720000000007,413.47710000000001,9,false],["need to bring them into your missional community\/",146.40000000000001,414.07510000000002,342.48030000000006,426.47710000000001,9,false],["team and continue the investment towards their",146.40000000000001,427.07510000000002,329.29620000000006,439.47710000000001,9,false],["maturity. They need to “go on mission” with you right",146.40000000000001,440.07510000000002,348.03420000000017,452.47710000000001,9,false],["away.",146.40000000000001,453.07510000000002,167.334,465.47710000000001,9,false],["A word of warning: Do not allow people you are",146.40000000000001,478.74210000000005,332.36460000000005,492.12510000000003,9,false],["journeying to Christ to ever see your missional map.",146.40000000000001,492.07510000000002,343.03020000000009,504.47710000000001,9,false],["We do not want people to ever feel like a “target” or a",146.40000000000001,505.07510000000002,344.43420000000015,517.47710000000006,9,false],["“project.”",146.40000000000001,518.07510000000002,182.2731,530.47710000000006,9,false],["MISSIONAL MAP 2",43.841200000000001,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,579.44749999999999,9,false],["Each person on the missional team should fill out",146.40000000000001,544.07510000000002,332.64420000000007,556.47709999999995,9,false],["and keep their own missional map for the sake of",146.40000000000001,557.07510000000002,330.75330000000008,569.47709999999995,9,false],["continuity in missional agreement and so that they",146.40000000000001,570.07510000000002,338.77230000000009,582.47709999999995,9,false],["can regularly pray for the list of people they have",146.40000000000001,583.07510000000002,329.7102000000001,595.47709999999995,9,false],["identified. Encourage each person to keep this in",146.40000000000001,596.07510000000002,330.18720000000008,608.47709999999995,9,false],["their Bible, on their bedstand, or wherever they may",146.40000000000001,609.07510000000002,342.86730000000011,621.47709999999995,9,false],["be reminded to pray daily for this group of people and",146.40000000000001,622.07510000000002,347.67420000000016,634.47709999999995,9,false],["their teammates.",146.40000000000001,635.07510000000002,211.0641,647.47710000000006,9,false],["This tool, like others, is imperfect, incomplete,",146.40000000000001,661.07510000000002,322.41030000000001,673.47709999999995,9,false],["insufficient, and in flux, so expect future modifications",146.40000000000001,674.07510000000002,352.20120000000009,686.47709999999995,9,false],["and please feel free to give your input to ESS@uscm.",146.40000000000001,687.07510000000002,344.77570000000003,699.47709999999995,9,false],["org. We appreciate the help!",146.40000000000001,700.07510000000002,251.98690000000002,712.47709999999995,9,false]],"w":612,"h":792}]}